message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: orbitaR
abstract: >-
  orbitaR is a Kohn–Sham DFT code in Rust with plane waves and the projector augmented-wave (PAW) method,
  for researchers who need a PAW code that they can read, change, and verify.
authors:
  - name: The orbitaR developers
